Without an idempotency key
  send:   (None, 'no response — did it happen?')
  retry:  (201, {'order_id': 2, 'sku': 'MRD-CLE-001', 'qty': 480})
  orders on the server: 2
  -> two orders. The customer receives 960 cloths.

With one
  send:   (None, 'no response — did it happen?')
  retry:  (200, {'order_id': 1, 'sku': 'MRD-CLE-001', 'qty': 480, 'replayed': True})
  orders on the server: 1
  -> one order, and the retry was told what the first one did.
